{"title":"Product-to-sum identities","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The product-to-sum identities are as follows:\n\\begin{align*}\n\\sin (x) \\sin (y) = \\frac{1}{2} (\\cos (x-y) - \\cos (x+y)) \\\\\n\\sin (x) \\cos (y) = \\frac{1}{2} (\\sin (x-y) + \\sin (x+y)) \\\\\n\\cos (x) \\cos (y) = \\frac{1}{2} (\\cos (x-y) + \\cos (x+y))\n\\end{align*}\nThey can be derived by expanding out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0ac20dd4b2eeb7ed5985c8230a33c0ac2249352a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4bab539c1f3c687c48df925591fff44e2f615b2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos (x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d6761a378bd2bfb9615aa4f155159fd2f57a6d1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin (x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/d/32d9b04d2d28925b4cc95f033af4c3e6781cb247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" />, then combining them to isolate each term.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Product-to-sum_identities&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Product-to-sum_identities&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometric_identities\" title=\"Trigonometric identities\">Trigonometric identities</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018015857\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 316/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 719/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.380      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.380      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:25199:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018015857 and revision id 219174. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}